### Products: seed data gives products 1-8 (`python -m app.seed`)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List products (filters: category_id, is_active, skip, limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category_id=1&is_active=true&limit=20

### Get one product
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Create a product  -> 201 (logs an "Opening stock" movement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KNT-001",
  "name": "Merino Cardigan",
  "description": "Soft merino wool",
  "price": "95.50",
  "stock_quantity": 12,
  "category_id": 1,
  "low_stock_threshold": 3,
  "is_active": true
}

### Duplicate SKU  -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "DRS-001", "name": "Copy", "price": "10.00", "category_id": 1 }

### Unknown category  -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "BAD-1", "name": "Nope", "price": "10.00", "category_id": 99999 }

### Invalid price  -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "BAD-2", "name": "Free?", "price": "-5", "category_id": 1 }

### Replace catalogue fields (PUT). Stock is NOT changed here; use /stock.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "DRS-001",
  "name": "Linen Wrap Dress",
  "description": "Breathable linen, knee length",
  "price": "94.90",
  "category_id": 1,
  "low_stock_threshold": 5,
  "is_active": true
}

### Deactivate a product (hides it from search, blocks new orders)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "ACC-003",
  "name": "Silk Scarf",
  "description": "Printed silk, 90cm square",
  "price": "28.00",
  "category_id": 3,
  "low_stock_threshold": 5,
  "is_active": false
}

### Delete a product that is in no order  -> 204 (a product that appears in an order gives 409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/8
